                                defaultExclusiveJoinTask);
                        continue;
                    }

                    taskStatus = exclusiveTask.getStatus();
                    foundExlusiveJoinOnTask = taskStatus.isTerminal();
                    hasFailures = !taskStatus.isSuccessful();
                    if (hasFailures) {
